Error [E0985]: `val` is no longer a binding keyword in Jet
  --> tests/ui/foreign_match.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     val x = 1;
    |     ^^^
 Why: bindings are written with a sigil: `name :: value` (immutable) or `name := value` (mutable)
 Fix: write `name :: value` instead of `val name = value`

Error [E0016]: Jet does not use `match`
  --> tests/ui/foreign_match.jet:3:5
    |
  3 |     match x {
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: choosing one branch from many is written with `if` (D-IF1)
 Fix: replace `match` with `if subject { arm -> body }`
